          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-03-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 7
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "ecall 自动完成保存全部状态、换页表和执行具体系统调用。",
      "correction": "本页只把 ecall 描述为受控进入内核入口的指令；其余工作由内核路径完成。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-03-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 14
          }
        },
